sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Buyer
    participant Wait as Waiting room
    participant Inv as Inventory service
    participant Lock as Seat lock
    participant Pay as Payment
    U->>Wait: join the queue at on-sale
    Wait-->>U: admitted with a token
    Note over Wait: the queue is what stops the stampede reaching inventory
    U->>Inv: show available seats
    Inv-->>U: seat map
    U->>Lock: reserve these seats
    alt lock acquired
        Lock-->>U: held for a short TTL
        U->>Pay: pay
        alt payment succeeds
            Pay->>Inv: mark sold
            Inv-->>U: tickets issued
        else payment fails or the TTL expires
            Lock->>Inv: release back to the pool
            Inv-->>U: seats lost
        end
    else someone else holds them
        Lock-->>U: pick different seats
    end
